<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Two adversaries, each defeated by what the other saw. The board is small; attention is the scarce resource.<\gray>
?else
<gray>You were the largest fleet too early. Both adversaries found the same target.<\gray>
?end
<blue>Log entry: adversary lineage 0 <shining>completed<\shining>. Lineage 1 begins with 0 as opponent.<\blue>
